 "ground": {
  "note": "Ground items. Kill drops (and items the player drops) are private to their owner for private_ticks, then public: anyone may take them, and nearby AI players walk over and loot piles worth at least ai_loot_min_value (market value x qty; coins count 1 each). Every drop despawns drop_ttl ticks after it fell. Death piles are owner-only for death_ttl ticks and are NEVER public. Abstract (tier-1) AI near a public pile claim it with abstract_claim_chance per 10-tick check.",
